#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:5 53b803ed999741738f3aefd8737fc368
msgid "Arming the motors"
msgstr "解锁推进器"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:7 560ff2b5c479474a99ee0c44f2d16b6c
msgid ""
"Arming the vehicle allows the thrusters to start spinning.  Before arming, "
"make sure all people, objects, and any body parts (e.g., hands) are clear of"
" the thruster propellers."
msgstr "解锁载具后，推进器将开始转动。解锁前，请确保所有人员、物体及身体部位（如手部）远离推进器螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:9 a298c10876f94b26bc824790225a6ea9
msgid "In order to arm:"
msgstr "解锁步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:11 65b852d509674e45b997fb4db4379f8f
msgid ""
"Pre-Arm safety checks must be passing (See :ref:`common-prearm-safety-"
"checks`). It is recommended that :ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` be "
"enabled for all available systems/sensors checks to prevent arming with "
"system issues present. You must have also provided a method to Disarm the "
"vehicle, either by GCS button assignments (``BTNx_FUNCTION``), or "
":ref:`AUX_FUNCTION <common-auxiliary-functions>`."
msgstr ""
"必须通过解锁前安全检查（参见 :ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks`）。建议启用 "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>` "
"对所有可用系统及传感器进行检查，以防止在存在系统问题时解锁。您还必须提供一种锁定载具的方法，可通过 GCS "
"按钮分配（``BTNx_FUNCTION``）或 :ref:`AUX_FUNCTION <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:12 2dd79633a5824f08856f599dd11718fa
msgid ""
"The throttle must be at idle value if :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 5 is"
" set (\"Arming check throttle for 0 input\"). Normally, this would be a "
"center stick if bi-directional vertical thrusters are used."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 第 5 "
"位已设置（「解锁时检查油门为零输入」），则油门必须处于怠速值。如果使用双向垂直推进器，通常对应摇杆居中位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:13 d9b4f5d3c1414b3ea2832179d4d4a51e
msgid ""
"An arming pilot control must be activated, eg. GCS joystick button with "
"\"Arm\" function assigned, GCS MAVLink ARM command given, or an "
":ref:`Auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-functions>` such as ARM/DISARM "
"(\"153\") is used by either GCS command or RC channel switch (if enabled)."
msgstr ""
"必须激活一个解锁飞手控制，例如：分配了「Arm」功能的 GCS 摇杆按钮、发送 GCS MAVLink ARM 指令，或通过 GCS 指令或 RC "
"通道开关（如已启用）使用 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 如 ARM/DISARM（「153」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:16 f51e12296081411a9b208370c2a7dd6f
msgid "Disarming the motors"
msgstr "锁定推进器"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:18 7283f3797d7040bfaf986c56a47aa28b
msgid ""
"Disarming the motors will prevent the motors from spinning. The motors are "
"disarmed when:"
msgstr "锁定推进器后，推进器将停止转动。以下情况下推进器会被锁定："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:20 baf2ba9d9eb64a6488d060ab6dd3e820
msgid "GCS joystick button with a \"Disarm\" function assigned is pressed."
msgstr "按下分配了「Disarm」功能的 GCS 摇杆按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:21 59122b2da2694e65a496ad7f7753430d
msgid "A MAVLink DISARM command is received"
msgstr "收到 MAVLink DISARM 指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:22 9f7fce863aad4d15b5284abb04862c90
msgid ""
"An :ref:`Auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-functions>` such as ARM/DISARM"
" (\"153\") is used by either GCS command or RC channel switch (if enabled)."
msgstr ""
"通过 GCS 指令或 RC 通道开关（如已启用）使用 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 如 "
"ARM/DISARM（「153」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:25 804aec29127a4dffb4048284ea06130d
msgid ""
"the AUX Function \"31\" (Motor Emergency Stop) or \"165\" (Arm/Motor "
"Emergency Stop) can also be used to prevent motor operations, but do not "
"\"Disarm\" which would reset the home location and require the pre-arming "
"checks to be passed before re-arming."
msgstr ""
"AUX "
"功能「31」（推进器紧急停止）或「165」（解锁/推进器紧急停止）也可用于阻止推进器运行，但不会执行「锁定」操作——锁定会重置归航位置，并要求重新通过解锁前检查才能再次解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:28 1745968cb5cd446a88488333cd8609c8
msgid "GCS Status Messages"
msgstr "GCS 状态消息"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-the-motors.rst:29 61c70cc6b7054239b4521878d42f91d6
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 2 is set, text messages"
" will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has occurred."
msgstr ""
"除非已设置 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 第 2 位，否则将向 GCS 发送文字消息以指示解锁或锁定事件。"
